SOLUTION 1
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    C(4) 0.05

SOLUTION 2
    temp 20
    pH 7 charge
    Ca 0.05

MIX 1
    1 0.5
    2 0.5

SAVE solution 1

EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Calcite 0 0

SAVE equilibrium_phases 1

USE solution 1
USE equilibrium_phases 1

REACTION_TEMPERATURE 1
    20 200 in 10 steps

PRINT
    -reset false

SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file mix_calcite.sel
    -reset false
    -temperature true
    -equilibrium_phases Calcite
